{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411240","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1241124001:1":{"text":"実を言うと、一度も海に出たことがないわけじゃないんだ。でも今回の冒険はひと味違う！","source_cn":"说实话，我也不是没出过海，但这次的冒险也太不一样了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2133A59622DC2899","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1241124001":{"text":"実を言うと、一度も海に出たことがないわけじゃないんだ。でも今回の冒険はひと味違う！","source_cn":"说实话，我也不是没出过海，但这次的冒险也太不一样了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2133A59622DC2899","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241124004:1":{"text":"そんなに遠くへは行ってない。ラスティーアンカーの周りをグルグルするぐらいだな。","source_cn":"其实之前也没去过很远的地方……也就是在锈锚港周边打转。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387AF0365DB96D5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241124005:1":{"text":"あの触手の海獣が現れる前までは、ラスティーアンカー周辺の海はとても安全だったんだ。だから天気がいい日に船を出すこともあったのさ。","source_cn":"那个触手海怪出现之前，锈锚港的海域很安全，我偶尔会在天...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01D4117F5EDC64F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1241124005":{"text":"あの触手の海獣が現れる前までは、ラスティーアンカー周辺の海はとても安全だったんだ。だから天気がいい日に船を出すこともあったのさ。","source_cn":"那个触手海怪出现之前，锈锚港的海域很安全，我偶尔会在天气好的时候出海转转。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01D4117F5EDC64F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241124006:1":{"text":"故障した商船や、海に落ちた商隊に……あと水泳訓練に参加していた冒険家とかもいたな。","source_cn":"抛锚的商船，落水的商队，还有正在参与游泳训练的冒险家……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC0C17FC8767C808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241124007:1":{"text":"冒険家？宝探しやモンスターと戦う冒険家が水泳訓練ですか？","source_cn":"冒险家一般不都是在和寻宝或者和怪物搏斗吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x425AE4E72D7A7F90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241124008:1":{"text":"ラスティーアンカーの海は水が澄んでて、暗礁が少ないんだ。だから泳ぐのが好きな冒険家が、そこで定期的に水泳大会を開くんだよ。誰が一番速く海峡を横断できるか競ったりな。","source_cn":"锈锚港的海域清澈，暗礁少，有不少爱好游泳的冒险家会定期...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74619B0A0339827D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241124009:1":{"text":"泳ぎのスキルをバカにしちゃいけねえ。海に近い場所を探検するとき、泳げるだけで命拾いすることだって多々あるんだ。","source_cn":"别小看游泳，在靠海的地方探险，会游泳有的时候能救命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24251B284EE71529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1241124010:1":{"text":"確かに……ロンロンはそれで死にかけました……","source_cn":"满满这次就吃够了苦头……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60CB9C6BA8096030","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1241124011:1":{"text":"シンドバッドさんの話を聞くと、ラスティーアンカーの海が危なくなったのは、死海の艦隊があの海獣を連れてきたのが原因のようですね。","source_cn":"听辛巴达的描述，锈锚港的海域都是从死潮舰队带来了那个触...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48452B63BE3741D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241124012:1":{"text":"そうだ。昔アレに襲われたことがある。一瞬で船がひっくり返って、必死に岸まで泳いでなんとか助かったんだ。","source_cn":"没错……我被那东西袭击过，船瞬间就被掀翻，我掉进海里后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF3F142C39045FF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241124013:1":{"text":"ええ！？そんなことがあったのに、また海に出るなんて、勇気がありますね！","source_cn":"天呐，经历过那种事，你居然还敢出海，好有勇气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA12F0A863DBC553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241124014:1":{"text":"ははっ、俺は運だけはいいからな！","source_cn":"哈哈，我命大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66726BE7E897075A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1241124015:1":{"text":"結局また海獣に襲われたけど、こうして特別な体験ができただろ？","source_cn":"虽然船被怪物拍到无名岛，但是我们不是也有一番奇遇吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E6419FA3EFD463A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241124016:1":{"text":"この先も、俺の幸運があんたらにラッキーをもたらすといいな。","source_cn":"希望接下来的冒险，我能继续给你们带来好运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF2F781A6F2D7E48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"何か面白い発見はあったか？","source_cn":"有什么奇遇？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x13B79929BDA1519D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"何か面白い発見はあったか？","female":"何か面白い発見はあった？","variant_male_record_index":"66988","variant_female_record_index":"66989","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"海の上で何か出会いはあったか？","source_cn":"碰到过什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC2BB1AD512F2FF8F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"海の上で何か出会いはあったか？","female":"海の上で何か出会いはあった？","variant_male_record_index":"66990","variant_female_record_index":"66991","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"今までどんな所に行ったんだ？","source_cn":"之前去过哪里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x226D20414FC412B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"今までどんな所に行ったんだ？","female":"今までどんな所に行ったの？","variant_male_record_index":"66984","variant_female_record_index":"66985","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1241124002:1":{"text":"うーん……上手く言えないけど、ここの不思議な空気のせいかな？","source_cn":"说不上来……我也不知道，大概是这里更神奇梦幻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAD785FF4EBF94A","variant_status":"",